#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introdución"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&choqok; is a micro-blogging client which currently supports Identi.ca/"
#| "Laconica and Twitter.com services."
msgid ""
"&choqok; is a micro-blogging client which currently supports Pump.io, GNU "
"social and Twitter.com services."
msgstr ""
"&choqok; é un cliente de microbloque compatíbel cos servizos Identi.ca "
"(antes coñecido como Laconica) e Twitter."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Micro-blogging is a form of multimedia blogging that allows users to send "
"brief text updates or micro media such as photos or audio clips and publish "
"them. These can be viewed either by anyone or by a restricted group, which "
"can be decided by the user. These messages can be submitted by a variety of "
"means, including text messaging, instant messaging, email, digital audio or "
"the web."
msgstr ""
"Un «microblogue» é un tipo de blogue que permite aos usuarios enviar curtas "
"actualizacións de texto ou ficheiros como imaxes ou sons. As mensaxes poden "
"compartirse publicamente ou cun grupo restrinxido de persoas seleccionado "
"polo usuario. As mensaxes poden publicarse de varios xeitos: mediante "
"mensaxes de texto, mensaxaría instantánea, correo electrónico, son dixital "
"ou internet."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
