msgstr "Usar &choqok;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Primeiros pasos"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the &choqok; main window there are some timelines allowing you to see "
"what your friends have posted, replies to them and direct messages sent and "
"received from friends. You can also post a new message."
msgstr ""
"A xanela principal de &choqok; mostra liñas de tempo que permiten ver as "
"mensaxes dos contactos, as respostas a estas, e mensaxes directas enviadas e "
"recibidas de contactos. Tamén pode publicar unha nova mensaxe."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All of this will be available when you configure at least one account in "
"&choqok;."
msgstr ""
"Todo isto estará dispoñíbel unha vez configure polo menos unha conta en "
"&choqok;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here is a screenshot of the &choqok; main window"
msgstr "Velaquí vai unha captura da xanela principal de Choqok."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "&choqok; main window"
msgstr "Xanela principal de Choqok."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You have one tab per account, on the screenshot you can see a tab with "
#| "the alias <guilabel>identica</guilabel> and another with the alias "
#| "<guilabel>twitter</guilabel>."
msgid ""
"You have one tab per account, on the screenshot you can see a tab with the "
"alias <guilabel>Pump.io</guilabel> and another with the alias "
"<guilabel>twitter</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Dispón dunha lapela por conta. Na captura pode verse unha lapela co alcume "
"<guilabel>identica</guilabel> e outra co alcume <guilabel>twitter</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On top of the tab you can choose to send a direct message to someone who is "
"subscribed to your account. You can send direct messages to other users of "
"the same service, as long as both of you are subscribed to each other. If "
"you leave <guilabel>Direct message to</guilabel> unchecked your message will "
"be posted publicly and all your friends will read it. If you check it, you "
"will then choose a name in the list and the private message will only be "
"posted to this person."
msgstr ""
"Na parte superior das lapelas pode elixir enviarlle unha mensaxe directa a "
"alguén que estea subscrito á súa conta. Pode enviarlle mensaxes directas a "
"usuarios do mesmo servizo, sempre que estean subscritos o un ao outro.Se "
"deixa a opción <guilabel>Dirixir mensaxe a</guilabel> sen marcar, a mensaxe "
"compartirase publicamente e poderana ler todos os seus contactos. Se a "
"marca, poderá elixir un dos seus contactos dunha lista, e a mensaxe só "
"poderá lela o contacto seleccionado."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The text area allows you to post your message which must have less than 140 "
"characters. The number of characters left is displayed in green on bottom "
"right under the text area. The color changes to orange when you reach the 30 "
"characters limit then to red when you reach 0. If your message is longer "
"than 140 characters, you will be asked if you want to post it anyway. If you "
"agree, it will be posted up to 140 characters."
msgstr ""
"A zona de texto permítelle redactar a mensaxe para publicar, que non poderá "
"exceder os 140 caracteres. O número de caracteres restantes móstrase en cor "
"verde na parte inferior dereita da zona de texto. A cor cambia a laranxa "
"cando non restan máis que 30 caracteres, e vólvese vermella cando chega ao "
"límite. Se a súa mensaxe supera os 140 caracteres, o programa preguntaralle "
"se quere publicala de todos xeitos; se acepta, publicaranse os seus "
"primeiros 140 caracteres."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Home</guilabel> tab displays the timeline which consists in "
#| "all posts you and your friends wrote. A post using Identi.ca is called a "
#| "dent while a post using Twitter is called a tweet."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Home</guilabel> tab displays the timeline which consists in "
"all posts you and your friends wrote. A post using Pump.io is called a post "
"while a post using Twitter is called a tweet."
msgstr ""
"A lapela <guilabel>Inicio</guilabel> mostra unha liña de tempo con todas as "
"mensaxes publicadas por vostede e os seus contactos."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Reply</guilabel> tab displays posts that are replies to you."
msgstr ""
"A lapela de <guilabel>Respostas</guilabel> mostra todas as mensaxes escritas "
"en resposta a vostede."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the private messages you sent will be displayed in the <guilabel>Outbox</"
"guilabel> tab while the received ones will be displayed in the "
"<guilabel>Inbox tab</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Todas as mensaxes privadas que enviase mostraranse na lapela "
"<guilabel>Saída</guilabel>, e as que recibise mostraranse na lapela "
"<guilabel>Entrada</guilabel>."

